{"Guest email uniqueness and case sensitivity not enforced server-side - duplicate entries in same request and case-variant duplicates (e.g. Foo@bar.com vs foo@bar.com) slip through, potentially causing duplicate attendee rows or allowing blacklisted addresses to bypass checks": 0.9744953513145447, "Team-level authorization incorrectly requires user to be both admin AND owner instead of either admin OR owner, causing FORBIDDEN errors for legitimate privileged users": 0.8246886730194092, "Email notifications sent to original guests array instead of sanitized uniqueGuests list, causing emails to be sent to filtered-out recipients (duplicates, blacklisted, or already on booking) who were not actually persisted": 0.964638888835907}